# Linear issue state

Never create Linear issues in **Triage** unless the user explicitly asks for Triage.

Default new issues to **Backlog**. Use **Todo** when the user wants the work ready to pick up.

Always set workflow state on create (CLI `--state`, MCP `state`). Omitting it often lands the issue in Triage because that is the team default.
